{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Cap of Time is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning {{TLoZ|-}} 30th Anniversary {{OoT|-}} Link amiibo. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain the Cap of Time. It can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

The Cap of Time, alongside the [[Tunic of Time]] and [[Trousers of Time]], comprise the [[Hero of Time Set]] which resembles Link's outfit from {{OoT}}. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the Master Sword Beam Up [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full set.

